Changes in version 1.1-0
- Updated package metadata for CRAN, including Authors@R, current Date,
  package URL, and DESCRIPTION wording
- Added an R-hub v2 GitHub Actions workflow
- Added build ignores for local development files, GitHub Actions workflows,
  source tarballs, and check directories
- Fixed make.fastDR.formula() handling of x.vars="." and missing
  weights.var
- Removed unconditional progress output from fastDR()
- Updated propensity score prediction iterations to pass integer tree counts
  to gbm3
- Cleaned documentation cross-references, examples, and stale Rd content

Changes in version 0.9
- Created the package merging in existing test code and creating help files
